---
/*
  The COMMUNITY lockup, rebuilt as original inline SVG from the approved
  concept: a C formed by an open ring of three flat-ended segments, completing
  into the wordmark. Geometry drawn from scratch; colours are the site tokens
  (brand #249FDA, accent #8DC63F), per the decision to use the token values
  rather than the concept image's own shades.

  One deliberate adaptation: the concept's third segment is the brand navy on a
  white ground. This lockup renders on the hero's navy ground, where navy would
  vanish, so that segment is white — the same swap the Plan-T mark itself uses
  on dark grounds (the og card). No gradients, no shadows, no bitmap.

  The wordmark tail is real text, so COMMUNITY stays selectable and readable by
  assistive tech through the aria-label; the visually hidden span keeps the full
  word in the page text for the content regression.
*/
---

<span class="ltr inline-flex items-center" role="img" aria-label="COMMUNITY">
  <svg data-community-logo width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 80 80" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- three arc segments, gaps between them; the ring opens toward the wordmark -->
    <path d="M 58.0 18.6 A 28 28 0 0 0 14.6 28.2" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="14" />
    <path d="M 13.0 32.8 A 28 28 0 0 0 32.8 67.0" stroke="#249FDA" stroke-width="14" />
    <path d="M 37.6 67.9 A 28 28 0 0 0 60.8 58.7" stroke="#8DC63F" stroke-width="14" />
  </svg>
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="ms-1 text-2xl font-black tracking-widest text-white">OMMUNITY</span>
  <span class="sr-only">COMMUNITY</span>
</span>
